["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"# Open the Eventlog authority once per command\n\n## Outcome\n\nOne `aep plan artifact` command opens the planning authority once and reuses that handle for the decision, the\ncommit and the projection, instead of opening and verifying the store again for each phase.\n\n## Why\n\nOn the `/2` Eventlog stores every write re-opened and re-verified the whole authority several times; an ESS `move`\ntook 541 s.\n\n## Delivered\n\naep#16, merged 2026-09-23 as `d85adc863`, released in AEP 0.58.0: ESS `move` 541 s → 245 s.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `crates/edge/aep-cli/src/planning.rs`\n- `crates/plan/aep-backend-eventlog/src/lib.rs`\n- `crates/plan/aep-planning-migration/src/{mutation,projection}.rs`\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{\"recorded\":{\"test_result\":1}}","target":"ent-ce36abd680fe8ecf54a6d7ee03c4f230","to":"implemented"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790327097746,"id":"ent-ce36abd680fe8ecf54a6d7ee03c4f230","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/open-the-eventlog-authority-once-per-command","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":6,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790327176269}},"status":"implemented"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-ce36abd680fe8ecf54a6d7ee03c4f230","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790327176269,"causation":"cmd-child-11a147730de726b9d2baa9ce49c0be51a98b534d15cd32ccbda90d4279fbf970","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-ce36abd680fe8ecf54a6d7ee03c4f230@6#0~04630c9ef69c6f4e","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-25T09:06:16Z"},"revision":6,"to_state":"implemented","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790327097746,"id":"ent-ce36abd680fe8ecf54a6d7ee03c4f230","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/open-the-eventlog-authority-once-per-command","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by"